{"id":"G2920","lemma":"κρίσις","transliteration":"krisis","sayIt":"krisis","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, feminine","gloss":"judgment","meaning":"κρίσις, -εως, ἡ\n(κρίνω), [in LXX chiefly for מִשְׁפָּט, also for רִיב, etc. ;]\n1. a seperating, selection (Arist., al.)\n2. a decision, judgment (cl.): Jhn.8:16, 1Ti.5:24, 2Pe.2:11, Ju 9; κ. κρίνειν, Jhn.7:24; in forensic sense, Act.8:33 (LXX) (see Page, in l); esp. of the Divine judgment, Jhn.3:19 5:24, 27 5:29-30 12:31 16:8, 11, 2Th.1:5, Heb.10:27, Jas.2:13 5:12, 2Pe.2:4, Rev.18:10; pl., Rev.16:7 19:2; of the last judgment, Mat.10:15 11:22, 24 12:36, 41-42 Luk.10:14 11:31-32, Heb.9:27, 2Pe.2:9 3:7, 1Jn.4:17, Ju 6 15; τῆς γεέννης, Mat.23:33.\n3. By meton. (as in LXX for מִשְׁפָּט, Isa.5:7, al.; דִּישׁוֹן, Dan.7:10), of the standard of judgment, right, justice: Mat.12:18, 20 (LXX, Isa 42:43) Isa 23:23, Luk.11:42; of the tribunal (a local court), Mat.5:21-22†\n(AS)","glosses":["judgment","justice","judgments","sentence","verdict","justly"],"count":46,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-5","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-5","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"judgment","kjv":"of the judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"of judgment","kjv":"of judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-11","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"of judgment","kjv":"of judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-11","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"of judgment","kjv":"of judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"justice","kjv":"judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"justice","kjv":"judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"of judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"judgment","kjv":"judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-12","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"judgment","kjv":"the judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"justice","kjv":"judgment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"sentence","kjv":"the damnation"}},{"chapterId":"luk-1